olumn":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Students will study Android APIs and learn to build significant Android applications.\nThe course will have a practical focus, with significant in-class programming, programming assignments\nand a large project (optionally with a partner). The course philosophy is that programming is learned by doing.\nWhile the course focuses on Android, we will learn general principles of software engineering\nand mobile app development.","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"key":"ENhoGoVZSF"}],"key":"OVUOXQhP7J"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":1},"end":{"line":22,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"The course assumes familiarity with programming and object-oriented terminology.\nThe course is taught entirely in Kotlin, the modern sibling of Java. We will spend a bit of time\nreviewing Kotlin, but you are expected to be familiar enough with Java that the transition\nwill be seamless. The course does not assume any previous experience with Android programming.","position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":1},"end":{"line":19,"column":1}},"key":"o8LBL8OapO"}],"key":"vCLC2k8K6H"}],"key":"ICBo25xsjL"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":24,"column":1},"end":{"line":24,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"My Experience","position":{"start":{"line":24,"column":1},"end":{"line":24,"column":1}},"key":"knCldRkTza"}],"identifier":"my-experience","label":"My Experience","html_id":"my-experience","implicit":true,"key":"WQnAAnVzH8"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"position":{"start":{"line":26,"column":1},"end":{"line":26,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"My background","position":{"start":{"line":26,"column":1},"end":{"line":26,"column":1}},"key":"hQsJw1ShdH"}],"identifier":"my-background","label":"My background","html_id":"my-background","implicit":true,"key":"yn2jhHgb5V"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":28,"column":1},"end":{"line":33,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"My review of this course is based on completing the curriculum with an A+ grade in Fall 2022.\nI went into Android Programming with a decent level of experience in Java,\nsome experience in iOS development with SwiftUI which is relevant for MVVM design patterns,\nand Django web app development for MVT design patterns.\nI had never used Kotlin before.\nI also had never used Android Studio before, so I had to learn that as well.","position":{"start":{"line":28,"column":1},"end":{"line":28,"column":1}},"key":"W2lZFsYPxk"}],"key":"otPsVKc5el"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":35,"column":1},"end":{"line":37,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"My certificate of completion for this course is\navailable ","position":{"start":{"line":35,"column":1},"end":{"line":35,"column":1}},"key":"Xvvs05thZw"},{"type":"link","url":"https://courses.edx.org/certificates/8f2a839ea8d64edba4b9b2ed6b172bb7","position":{"start":{"line":35,"column":1},"end":{"line":35,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"here","position":{"start":{"line":35,"column":1},"end":{"line":35,"column":1}},"key":"I1sTOi497t"}],"urlSource":"https://courses.edx.org/certificates/8f2a839ea8d64edba4b9b2ed6b172bb7","key":"Gci4PQMnqr"},{"type":"text","value":".\nNote - This is a MSCS course at UT Austin and my GPA is only available on my official MSCS UT Austin transcript.","position":{"start":{"line":35,"column":1},"end":{"line":35,"column":1}},"key":"z64qMhUE7Z"}],"key":"UVmhKhN06q"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"position":{"start":{"line":39,"column":1},"end":{"line":39,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"My Review","position":{"start":{"line":39,"column":1},"end":{"line":39,"column":1}},"key":"q5ORjzB6Vw"}],"identifier":"my-review","label":"My Review","html_id":"my-review","implicit":true,"key":"H091fogzEl"},{"type":"table","position":{"start":{"line":41,"column":1},"end":{"line":48,"column":1}},"chi